---
Olivia Orange: Hey Peachy! Now that the Spring Fling is coming up. 
Olivia Orange: You'll have lots of suitors lining up to ask you out.
<<jump Node_1775713450174>>
===

title: Node_1775713450174
position: -272,-6
---
Olivia Orange: I'll help you learn how to reject the ones you're not interested and protect your heart. Let's get started.
//<<jump Node_1776154164506>>
===

title: Node_1776154164506
position: -274,104
---
Olivia Orange: This peach is your "Heart". The bar next to it is how much health your heart has.
Olivia Orange: The more unwanted suitors you let into your heart, the more your health goes down.
Olivia Orange: The indicator above is your level objective. 
Olivia Orange: You must get 5 of the wanted suitors into your heart to complete the level.
//<<jump Node_1776156479815>>
===

title: Node_1776156479815
position: -59,-154
---
Olivia Orange: This is where suitors will spawn. Both wanted and unwanted.
<<jump Node_1776157009657>>
===

title: Node_1776157009657
position: -43,4
---
Olivia Orange: The shop on your left will have rejection turrets that you can use to reject unwanted suitors.
Olivia Orange: Click on the turret. This is your "Ghosting" turret. Place it on the green square.
//<<jump Node_1776157366180>>
===

title: Node_1776157366180
position: -24,150
---
Olivia Orange: This allows you to "Ghost your suitor" to deflect their advances by reducing their health.
Olivia Orange: Lets see this turret in action!
//<<jump Node_1776157442870>>
===

title: Node_1776157442870
position: 166,-155
---
Olivia Orange: Great work!
Olivia Orange: Some suitors are "extra persistent" and may be too fast for your ghosting turret.
Olivia Orange: Click on the new turret. This is your "Another Time" turret. Place it on the green square.
//<<jump Node_1776157661033>>
===

title: Node_1776157661033
position: 178,3
---
Olivia Orange: This allows you to tell your suitor "another time" by buying time and temporarily slowing them down.
Olivia Orange: Lets see this turret in action!
//<<jump Node_1776157809963>>
===

title: Node_1776157809963
position: 173,125
---
Olivia Orange: Awesome!
Olivia Orange: Now that you know how to reject unwanted suitors. Its time to show you how to attract wanted suitors.
Olivia Orange: This is your "Chat Bubble" and "Gift" turret.
Olivia Orange: Click on the new turrets and place chat bubble on the green square and the gift on pink square.
//<<jump Node_1776157986163>>
===

title: Node_1776157986163
position: 386,-146
---
Olivia Orange: These are courting turrets which protect your wanted suitors from your rejection attacks.
Olivia Orange: The Chat Bubble turret allow you to "chat with your suitor" by temporarily shielding them from attacks.
Olivia Orange: The Chocolate Gift turret allow you to "give a gift to your suitor" by replenishing the suitor's health.
Olivia Orange: These turrets will automatically protect the wanted suitor and avoid any unwanted suitors.
Olivia Orange: Lets see these turrets in action! 
//<<jump Node_1776158510833>>
===

title: Node_1776158510833
position: 386,-38
---
Olivia Orange: Notice how the wanted suitors look a little different than unwanted suitors.
Olivia Orange: Crazy how love can make you view the world differently hehe.
//<<jump Node_1776158694780>>
===

title: Node_1776158694780
position: 379,54
---
Olivia Orange: Almost done! Just a few more things you should know.
Olivia Orange: Whenever you successfully reject an unwanted suitor you gain confidence points.
Olivia Orange: You can use these points in the shop to buy and place more turrets.
Olivia Orange: If you need a reminder of what each turret does, hover over their icon to see a tooltip of their stats!
Olivia Orange: As you progress through each level and gain confidence, you will unlock more turrets and new types of suitors.
Olivia Orange: Once you've talked to all your wanted suitors, you will need to make a choice on who to take to the dance.
Olivia Orange: Good luck and don't settle for less! You're amazing and anyone here will be lucky to have you!
===
